OL,3,AUS envoys meet Zelensky in Ukraine
OL,4,Aafter talks with Putin in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky is holding
OL,7,Ftalks with Donald Trump's top envoys,
OL,8,Fin their first visit to Ukraine since
OL,9,FRussia's full-scale invasion.
OL,11,FThe Ukrainian leader greeted Steve
OL,12,FWitkoff and Jared Kushner at Kyiv's St
OL,13,FSophia Cathedral, close to where a
OL,14,FRussian drone hit the headquarters of
OL,15,FUkraine's security services on Friday.
OL,17,FAhead of the meeting, Zelensky said
OL,18,FUkraine was ready to talk about
OL,19,Fbringing "the end of the war closer".
OL,20,FBut he said security guarantees would
OL,21,Fbe required as well as a dignified
OL,22,Fpost-war peace.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
